  Model --> Decide[Decision Engine]
  Decide --> Store[(Decision Store)]
  Decide --> Action[Action Executor]
  Decide --> Queue[Review Queue]
  Queue --> Console[Reviewer Console]
  Console --> Store
  Ingest --> Bus[(Event Bus)]
  Bus --> Offline[Offline Training]
```

